    &lt;p>
A formal minimalist view based on mathematics and logic that      
&lt;br>•&amp;#160;&amp;#160;&amp;#160;&amp;#160;&amp;#160;&amp;#160;&amp;#160;Defines abstractly the concept of a &amp;ldquo;conceptual&amp;rdquo; system

    &lt;/p>

    &lt;p>
A real system is then anything that can be modeled by a conceptual system.      
&lt;br>•&amp;#160;&amp;#160;&amp;#160;&amp;#160;&amp;#160;&amp;#160;&amp;#160;Implies: if we can&amp;rsquo;t model it we can&amp;rsquo;t call it a system

    &lt;/p>

